			"contents": "Package Control Messages\n========================\n\n\nA File Icon\n-----------\n\n  Version 4.0.0\n  =============\n  \n  A File Icon now relies on Sublime Text's core icon theme support\n  and provides commands to select and customize installed icon themes.\n  \n  Icon themes are defined by `<Name>.sublime-file-icons` files.\n  \n  This breaking change may cause visible changes in various themes\n  as it now behaves as if former `\"force_mode\": true` setting was set.\n  \n  This version requires Sublime Text 4206+\n  \n  Major Changes\n  -------------\n  \n  - the `zzz A File Icon` overlay package is gone\n  - no longer ships `file_type_...tmPreferences` files\n  - no longer creates alias or dummy syntax definitions\n  - no longer merges its icons with those from themes\n    as it is expected for themes to ship their own .sublime-file-icons files\n  \n  Basic theme patches to support icon tinting and tweaking transparency and size\n  are still created in ST's cache folder to get them out of sight.\n  \n  Usage\n  -----\n  \n  Run \"UI: Select Icon Theme\" from Command Palette to switch between installed icon themes.\n  \n  Run \"UI: Customize Icon Theme\" from Command Palette to add or change icon assignments.\n\n\nBracketHighlighter\n------------------\n\n  # BracketHighlighter\n  \n  New release!\n  \n  A restart might be required. If you see issues immediately after the update  \n  please try restarting.\n  \n  ## 2.33.0\n  \n  -   **NEW**: Release special branch for Sublime Text 4201+.\n\n\nFileIcons\n---------\n\n  New: FileIcons Theme for Sublime 4206+\n  ======================================\n  \n  We've created a new version of this package\n  that has more icons in both color and monochrome,\n  and is easier to use with any UI theme.\n  \n  This original version of the package will no longer be updated.\n  \n  It's available as \"FileIcons Theme\" on Package Control:\n  \n  https://packages.sublimetext.com/packages/FileIcons%20Theme\n\n\nSFTP\n----\n\n  SFTP 3.0.0 Changelog:\n  \n  ** New Features **\n  \n   - Support for Sublime Text v4205 and newer\n   - psftp.exe version 0.85 for SFTP connections on Windows\n  \n  All licenses purchased:\n  \n   - Since April 1, 2025 are already valid v3 license keys!\n   - Before April 1, 2025 may be upgraded from v2 to v3 for $15.\n     See https://codexns.io/products/sftp_for_sublime/upgrade.\n",
